Error [E2113]: `optimize` is pinned to `full` at @build.jet:3, so `--optimize=none` can't change it
 Why: `b.pin(.option, .Value)` in `fn build` fixes a build option for every build; a flag may only change values that aren't pinned
 Fix: Remove the flag, or remove the pin at @build.jet:3
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2113
